P3para.Text:
in the words before paragraph (a), after  “this Part” insert “
                        or the Railways Act 2005 that are not safety functions
                      ”;

in paragraph (b), after  “this Part” insert “
                        or that Act
                      ”;

in subsection (2), for  “paragraphs (a) and (b) of section 124(1)” substitute “
                        subsection (1)(a) and (b) of section 124 or those set out in subsection (1A)(a) to (d) of that section
                      ”;

for  “Authority”, where first occurring, substitute “
                          Secretary of State
                        ”;

for  “The Authority shall not” substitute “
                          Neither the Secretary of State nor the Scottish Ministers shall
                        ”;

for  “The Authority shall not” substitute “
                          Neither the Secretary of State nor the Scottish Ministers shall
                        ”;

for the words from  “subsection (3)” to  “subsection (4)” substitute “
                          subsections (3) and (4)
                        ”;

after  “in the register” insert “
                          (except so far as they are required to be entered in the register maintained under section 73A below)
                        ”;

P2para.Text:
In section 18(5)(b) of the 1974 Act (duty of enforcing authority to act in accordance with guidance of HSC), at the beginning insert “
                    except where that authority is the Office of Rail Regulation,
                  ”.

In section 420(8) of that Act (orders subject to negative resolution procedure), after  “section 242(10)” insert— “
                    section 252E;
                  ”.

P3para.Text:
for  “Authority”, wherever occurring, substitute “
                        Secretary of State or the Scottish Ministers
                      ”;

in paragraph (a), for  “of the Authority's functions“ substitute “
                        of the functions of the Secretary of State or of the Scottish Ministers
                      ”;

in paragraph (b), for  “Schedule 21 to the Transport Act 2000” substitute “
                        section 1(2) of the Railways Act 2005
                      ”;

in subsection (1), for  “under this Act to make orders” substitute “
                    or the Scottish Ministers under this Act to make orders (except the power to make provisional or final orders under section 55)
                  ”;

P4para.Text:
for  “or the Transport Act 2000” substitute “
                            , the Transport Act 2000 or the Railways Act 2005
                          ”;

for  “each Rail Passengers' Committee” substitute “
                            the London Transport Users' Committee
                          ”;

in paragraphs (a), (b) and (c), for  “Rail Passengers' Committee”, in each place, substitute “
                            the London Transport Users' Committee
                          ”;

after  “Rail Passengers' Council” insert “
                            and the London Transport Users' Committee
                          ”;

P3para.Text:
in paragraph (f), for the words from  “Strategic” to the end substitute “
                        Secretary of State
                      ”;

in paragraph (c) of that subsection, for  “requiring the Authority” substitute “
                        for the Secretary of State
                      ”;

for  “Rail Passengers' Committees” substitute “
                        London Transport Users' Committee
                      ”;

in paragraph (a), for  “sections 76 and 77” substitute “
                        section 76
                      ”;
